# Stock & POS — backend

Skill: `.cursor/skills/stock-pos-build/SKILL.md` (backend status + remaining cleanup)

## Platform

- Keep FastAPI modules under `app/modules/...`; API prefix `/api/v1`.
- Preserve success `{ data, meta }` and error `{ detail: { code, message, field_errors? } }` envelopes.
- Money: `Decimal` / `NUMERIC` only.

## Domain

- Centralize stock mutation; every stock change writes an immutable movement.
- Customer/supplier debt via ledgers; do not allow manual debt edits through normal CRUD.
- Purchase/sale/return/payment: single transaction, rollback on any failure.
- Accept dimensional line snapshots (`height`, `width`, `quantity`, `square_meter`, amounts).
- Sale header extras: `other_charge` (not delivery fee). Purchase extras: `other_cost`.
- Never allow silent negative stock.

## Removals (Phase 4 — after safe migrate/backfill)

- Do not register Delivery Note or UOM routers once those features are removed.
- Drop product `uom_id`, min stock, expiry fields, and customer `credit_limit` only after backfill/data safety.
- Drop expiry scheduler/Telegram expiry tasks when expiry is fully removed; keep Redis optional-safe.
- Migrations: add/backfill first, remove FKs later, drop obsolete tables last. Seeds must be idempotent.

## Reports

- Statement rows: opening, debit, credit, running, closing.
- Exports (PDF/Excel) must cover the full filtered result set, not only the current page.
